ampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bcdd8a447bacc47802f8795d96c665a346c1d756", "message": "The redirect does not seem to work, let's get some normal output to check", "created_at": "2012-05-25T02:59:45Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95c0a50e059222aae4ccfc568e557cd01c91534f", "message": "Woops, had 2 http:// in the redirect reference, bad copy n paste", "created_at": "2012-05-25T02:53:50Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43d37eeec3ff9c351fd46d2b3dbe4356219a14cd", "message": "Let's try a 404.html file as a redirect substitute for missing files", "created_at": "2012-05-25T02:50:29Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "926db485e9646d1c43d09ebd1409fc63133df59b", "message": "More CSS tweaks, added a lib/. assets folder, moved internal help to htm/\n\nIn this context a \"htm\" file in lib/htm/some.htm is a \"HyperText Module\"\nwhere the content is wrapped with an element with a unique ID and may\ninclude it's own style and script tags. The idea is that it can be a self\ncontained \"module\" that tries not to require the main global page space\nto know about included modules in advance.", "created_at": "2012-05-23T05:06:47Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "05244ce4c9d25e743b9f25225499786477496cd7", "message": "Quite a few fancy CSS changes, still need more vendor prefixes", "created_at": "2012-05-21T07:29:13Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "58d5de19f7acde76fa12e57f2714fe3064fc0ce5", "message": "Added white background to preview section and box-shadow to top bar", "created_at": "2012-05-20T06:48:51Z", "repo": "markup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2abe141581abad0de2